'>{}</span>", "ja512:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:21.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:21.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:21.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:21.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:22.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:23.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:23.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:23.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:23.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:24.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:24.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:24.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:24.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:25.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:25.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:25.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:25.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:26.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:26.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:26.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:26.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:27.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:27.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:27.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:27.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:28.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:28.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:28.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:28.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:29.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:29.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:29.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:29.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:30.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:30.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:30.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:30.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja512:31.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:31.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:31.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja512:31.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja512:32.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja512:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja512:0.2": "Tiṁsanipāta ", "ja512:0.3": "Kiṁchandavagga ", "ja512:0.4": "2. Kumbhajātaka ", "ja512:1.1": "“Ko pāturāsī tidivā nabhamhi, ", "ja512:1.2": "Obhāsayaṁ saṁvariṁ candimāva; ", "ja512:1.3": "Gattehi te rasmiyo niccharanti, ", "ja512:1.4": "Sateratā vijjurivantalikkhe. ", "ja512:2.1": "So chinnavātaṁ kamasī aghamhi, ", "ja512:2.2": "Vehāyasaṁ gacchasi tiṭṭhasī ca; ", "ja512:2.3": "Iddhī nu te vatthukatā subhāvitā, ", "ja512:2.4": "Anaddhagūnaṁ api devatānaṁ. ", "ja512:3.1": "Vehāyasaṁ gammamāgamma tiṭṭhasi, ", "ja512:3.2": "Kumbhaṁ kiṇāthāti yametamatthaṁ; ", "ja512:3.3": "Ko vā tuvaṁ kissa vā tāya kumbho, ", "ja512:3.4": "Akkhāhi me brāhmaṇa etamatthaṁ”. ", "ja512:4.1": "“Na sappikumbho napi telakumbho, ", "ja512:4.2": "Na phāṇitassa na madhussa kumbho; ", "ja512:4.3": "Kumbhassa vajjāni anappakāni, ", "ja512:4.4": "Dose bahū kumbhagate suṇātha. ", "ja512:5.1": "Gaḷeyya yaṁ pitvā pate papātaṁ, ", "ja512:5.2": "Sobbhaṁ guhaṁ candaniyoḷigallaṁ; ", "ja512:5.3": "Bahumpi bhuñjeyya abhojaneyyaṁ, ", "ja512:5.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:6.1": "Yaṁ pitva cittasmimanesamāno, ", "ja512:6.2": "Āhiṇḍatī goriva bhakkhasādī; ", "ja512:6.3": "Anāthamāno upagāyati naccati ca, ", "ja512:6.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:7.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvā acelova naggo, ", "ja512:7.2": "Careyya gāme visikhantarāni; ", "ja512:7.3": "Sammūḷhacitto ativelasāyī, ", "ja512:7.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:8.1": "Yaṁ pitva uṭṭhāya pavedhamāno, ", "ja512:8.2": "Sīsañca bāhuñca pacālayanto; ", "ja512:8.3": "So naccatī dārukaṭallakova, ", "ja512:8.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:9.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvā aggidaḍḍhā sayanti, ", "ja512:9.2": "Atho sigālehipi khāditāse; ", "ja512:9.3": "Bandhaṁ vadhaṁ bhogajāniñcupenti, ", "ja512:9.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:10.1": "Yaṁ pitva bhāseyya abhāsaneyyaṁ, ", "ja512:10.2": "Sabhāyamāsīno apetavattho; ", "ja512:10.3": "Sammakkhito vantagato byasanno, ", "ja512:10.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:11.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvā ukkaṭṭho āvilakkho, ", "ja512:11.2": "Mameva sabbā pathavīti maññe; ", "ja512:11.3": "Na me samo cāturantopi rājā, ", "ja512:11.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:12.1": "Mānātimānā kalahāni pesuṇī, ", "ja512:12.2": "Dubbaṇṇinī naggayinī palāyinī; ", "ja512:12.3": "Corāna dhuttāna gatī niketo, ", "ja512:12.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:13.1": "Iddhāni phītāni kulāni assu, ", "ja512:13.2": "Anekasāhassadhanāni loke; ", "ja512:13.3": "Ucchinnadāyajjakatānimāya, ", "ja512:13.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:14.1": "Dhaññaṁ dhanaṁ rajataṁ jātarūpaṁ, ", "ja512:14.2": "Khettaṁ gavaṁ yattha vināsayanti; ", "ja512:14.3": "Ucchedanī vittavataṁ kulānaṁ, ", "ja512:14.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:15.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā dittarūpova poso, ", "ja512:15.2": "Akkosati mātaraṁ pitarañca; ", "ja512:15.3": "Sassumpi gaṇheyya athopi suṇhaṁ, ", "ja512:15.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:16.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā dittarūpāva nārī, ", "ja512:16.2": "Akkosatī sasuraṁ sāmikañca; ", "ja512:16.3": "Dāsampi gaṇhe paricārakampi, ", "ja512:16.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:17.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvāna haneyya poso, ", "ja512:17.2": "Dhamme ṭhitaṁ samaṇaṁ brāhmaṇaṁ vā; ", "ja512:17.3": "Gacche apāyampi tatonidānaṁ, ", "ja512:17.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:18.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvā duccaritaṁ caranti, ", "ja512:18.2": "Kāyena vācāya ca cetasā ca; ", "ja512:18.3": "Nirayaṁ vajanti duccaritaṁ caritvā, ", "ja512:18.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:19.1": "Yaṁ yācamānā na labhanti pubbe, ", "ja512:19.2": "Bahuṁ hiraññampi pariccajantā; ", "ja512:19.3": "So taṁ pivitvā alikaṁ bhaṇāti, ", "ja512:19.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:20.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā pesane pesiyanto, ", "ja512:20.2": "Accāyike karaṇīyamhi jāte; ", "ja512:20.3": "Atthampi so nappajānāti vutto, ", "ja512:20.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:21.1": "Hirīmanāpi ahirīkabhāvaṁ, ", "ja512:21.2": "Pātuṁ karonti madanāya mattā; ", "ja512:21.3": "Dhīrāpi santā bahukaṁ bhaṇanti, ", "ja512:21.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:22.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā ekathūpā sayanti, ", "ja512:22.2": "Anāsakā thaṇḍiladukkhaseyyaṁ; ", "ja512:22.3": "Dubbaṇṇiyaṁ āyasakyañcupenti, ", "ja512:22.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:23.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā pattakhandhā sayanti, ", "ja512:23.2": "Gāvo kuṭahatāva na hi vāruṇiyā; ", "ja512:23.3": "Vego narena susahoriva, ", "ja512:23.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:24.1": "Yaṁ manussā vivajjenti, ", "ja512:24.2": "sappaṁ ghoravisamiva; ", "ja512:24.3": "Taṁ loke visasamānaṁ, ", "ja512:24.4": "ko naro pātumarahati. ", "ja512:25.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā andhakaveṇḍaputtā, ", "ja512:25.2": "Samuddatīre paricārayantā; ", "ja512:25.3": "Upakkamuṁ musalehaññamaññaṁ, ", "ja512:25.4": "Tassā puṇṇaṁ kumbhamimaṁ kiṇātha. ", "ja512:26.1": "Yaṁ ve pitvā pubbadevā pamattā, ", "ja512:26.2": "Tidivā cutā sassatiyā samāya; ", "ja512:26.3": "Taṁ tādisaṁ majjamimaṁ niratthakaṁ, ", "ja512:26.4": "Jānaṁ mahārāja kathaṁ piveyya. ", "ja512:27.1": "Nayimasmiṁ kumbhasmiṁ dadhi vā madhu vā, ", "ja512:27.2": "Evaṁ abhiññāya kiṇāhi rāja; ", "ja512:27.3": "Evañhimaṁ kumbhagatā mayā te, ", "ja512:27.4": "Akkhātarūpaṁ tava sabbamitta”. ", "ja512:28.1": "“Na me pitā vā athavāpi mātā, ", "ja512:28.2": "Etādisā yādisako tuvaṁsi; ", "ja512:28.3": "Hitānukampī paramatthakāmo, ", "ja512:28.4": "Sohaṁ karissaṁ vacanaṁ tavajja. ", "ja512:29.1": "Dadāmi te gāmavarāni pañca, ", "ja512:29.2": "Dāsīsataṁ satta gavaṁsatāni; ", "ja512:29.3": "Ājaññayutte ca rathe dasa ime, ", "ja512:29.4": "Ācariyo hosi mamatthakāmo”. ", "ja512:30.1": "“Taveva dāsīsatamatthu rāja, ", "ja512:30.2": "Gāmā ca gāvo ca taveva hontu; ", "ja512:30.3": "Ājaññayuttā ca rathā taveva, ", "ja512:30.4": "Sakkohamasmī tidasānamindo. ", "ja512:31.1": "Maṁsodanaṁ sappipāyāsaṁ bhuñja, ", "ja512:31.2": "Khādassu ca tvaṁ madhumāsapūve; ", "ja512:31.3": "Evaṁ tuvaṁ dhammarato janinda, ", "ja512:31.4": "Anindito saggamupehi ṭhānan”ti. ", "ja512:32.1": "Kumbhajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja512:0.1": "", "ja512:0.2": "", "ja512:0.3": "", "ja512:0.4": "", "ja512:1.1": "", "ja512:1.2": "", "ja512:1.3": "", "ja512:1.4": "Sateratā → sateritā (bj, mr) ", "ja512:2.1": "", "ja512:2.2": "Vehāyasaṁ → vehāsayaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) | gammamāgamma → kamamāgamma (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); saṅkammāgamma (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:2.3": "", "ja512:2.4": "", "ja512:3.1": "", "ja512:3.2": "", "ja512:3.3": "", "ja512:3.4": "", "ja512:4.1": "", "ja512:4.2": "", "ja512:4.3": "", "ja512:4.4": "", "ja512:5.1": "Gaḷeyya → galeyya (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) | pitvā → pītvā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:5.2": "", "ja512:5.3": "", "ja512:5.4": "", "ja512:6.1": "Yaṁ pitva → yaṁ ve pītvā (bj); yaṁ pītvā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:6.2": "bhakkhasādī → bhakkhasārī (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja512:6.3": "", "ja512:6.4": "", "ja512:7.1": "", "ja512:7.2": "", "ja512:7.3": "", "ja512:7.4": "", "ja512:8.1": "Yaṁ pitva → yaṁ ve pītvā (bj); yaṁ pītvā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:8.2": "bāhuñca → bāhañca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:8.3": "", "ja512:8.4": "", "ja512:9.1": "", "ja512:9.2": "", "ja512:9.3": "", "ja512:9.4": "", "ja512:10.1": "Yaṁ pitva → yaṁ ve pītvā (bj); yaṁ pītvā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:10.2": "", "ja512:10.3": "", "ja512:10.4": "", "ja512:11.1": "", "ja512:11.2": "maññe → maññati (bj) ", "ja512:11.3": "", "ja512:11.4": "", "ja512:12.1": "", "ja512:12.2": "", "ja512:12.3": "", "ja512:12.4": "", "ja512:13.1": "", "ja512:13.2": "", "ja512:13.3": "", "ja512:13.4": "", "ja512:14.1": "", "ja512:14.2": "", "ja512:14.3": "Ucchedanī vittavataṁ → ucchedanī vittagataṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); ucchedanivittagataṁ (mr) ", "ja512:14.4": "", "ja512:15.1": "dittarūpova → duṭṭharūpova (bj) ", "ja512:15.2": "", "ja512:15.3": "", "ja512:15.4": "", "ja512:16.1": "dittarūpāva → duṭṭharūpāva (bj) ", "ja512:16.2": "", "ja512:16.3": "", "ja512:16.4": "", "ja512:17.1": "Yaṁ ve pivitvāna → yaṁ ve pitvāna (sya1ed, sya2ed); yañce pītvāna (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:17.2": "", "ja512:17.3": "", "ja512:17.4": "", "ja512:18.1": "", "ja512:18.2": "", "ja512:18.3": "", "ja512:18.4": "", "ja512:19.1": "", "ja512:19.2": "", "ja512:19.3": "", "ja512:19.4": "", "ja512:20.1": "", "ja512:20.2": "", "ja512:20.3": "", "ja512:20.4": "", "ja512:21.1": "", "ja512:21.2": "madanāya → madirāya (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja512:21.3": "", "ja512:21.4": "", "ja512:22.1": "", "ja512:22.2": "", "ja512:22.3": "", "ja512:22.4": "", "ja512:23.1": "", "ja512:23.2": "", "ja512:23.3": "", "ja512:23.4": "", "ja512:24.1": "", "ja512:24.2": "ghoravisamiva → … visammiva (bj, pts-vp-pli1); … visaṁ iva (mr); … visāmiva (?) ", "ja512:24.3": "", "ja512:24.4": "", "ja512:25.1": "andhakaveṇḍaputtā → andhakaveṇhuputtā (bj, pts-vp-pli1); aṇḍakaveṇḍaputtā (mr) ", "ja512:25.2": "", "ja512:25.3": "", "ja512:25.4": "", "ja512:26.1": "", "ja512:26.2": "", "ja512:26.3": "", "ja512:26.4": "", "ja512:27.1": 